WEBVTT

01:33.299 --> 01:35.570
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.630 --> 01:37.930
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:37.999 --> 01:40.900
(Episode 21)

01:59.719 --> 02:01.460
Why is the paper still blank?

02:03.260 --> 02:04.329
I don't know what to write.

02:06.329 --> 02:08.600
Just write down what you worry about the most.

02:10.570 --> 02:12.070
There should at least be someone you worry about the most.

02:15.439 --> 02:16.909
This is going to be a tough battle.

02:17.469 --> 02:19.610
We might not return alive if we go.

02:22.450 --> 02:25.580
Just write down what you want to say to them.

03:01.490 --> 03:02.219
Xu Qin.

03:04.390 --> 03:05.819
If you receive this letter,

03:07.259 --> 03:07.920
then I...

03:08.759 --> 03:10.529
I might not be alive anymore.

03:12.229 --> 03:13.159
After being apart for so long,

03:13.800 --> 03:14.830
I've matured a lot.

03:15.770 --> 03:17.569
But I still haven't learned how to say goodbye to you.

03:19.800 --> 03:21.240
I have no worries.

03:21.539 --> 03:22.539
I don't have many regrets.

03:23.140 --> 03:23.870
Only you...

03:24.809 --> 03:26.539
make me feel secure and warm.

03:28.450 --> 03:29.309
The thought of you...

03:30.279 --> 03:31.150
gives meaning...

03:32.180 --> 03:33.319
to my future.

03:35.219 --> 03:36.689
The cold and hot weather aren't torturous.

03:37.490 --> 03:39.490
Guns and bullets aren't terrifying.

03:40.960 --> 03:42.860
I want to be someone who can stand next to you...

03:44.390 --> 03:45.960
and make you happy.

04:33.179 --> 04:33.840
Cover!

06:21.320 --> 06:22.320
Song Yan.

06:23.590 --> 06:24.349
Song Yan.

06:25.560 --> 06:26.390
Song Yan.

06:26.859 --> 06:27.789
Song Yan.

06:32.659 --> 06:33.460
Gauze.

06:50.679 --> 06:52.279
If that day doesn't come,

06:53.919 --> 06:55.150
I hope you know...

06:56.919 --> 06:58.789
that there was someone in this world...

07:00.190 --> 07:01.590
who tried his best...

07:03.830 --> 07:04.960
to be with you.

07:11.400 --> 07:12.169
Don't move.

07:12.869 --> 07:14.000
Your wound might rupture.

07:15.010 --> 07:16.340
You're really lucky.

07:17.210 --> 07:18.940
If it didn't take the bullet for you,

07:19.010 --> 07:20.779
the bullet would have hit your artery.

07:21.140 --> 07:22.450
Then you won't be lying here.

07:37.630 --> 07:38.929
She's quite pretty.

07:40.099 --> 07:41.029
Is she your girlfriend?

07:42.070 --> 07:43.500
I've never heard you mention her before.

07:44.000 --> 07:44.799
Who is she?

07:48.539 --> 07:50.010
She's the one I'm going to marry.

07:52.279 --> 07:53.779
When I become successful,

07:55.049 --> 07:56.310
I'll go back and marry her.

07:58.650 --> 08:00.080
You did well this time.

08:00.349 --> 08:01.789
The team has rewarded you with second-rate merit.

08:03.320 --> 08:04.549
Once you recover,

08:05.119 --> 08:06.320
you'll be promoted.

08:06.820 --> 08:08.989
You can marry her in style then.

08:15.570 --> 08:16.830
If that day comes,

08:18.229 --> 08:20.270
I'll run to you in the light,

08:21.940 --> 08:23.140
hold your hand,

08:24.210 --> 08:26.140
and share all my glory and pride...

08:26.979 --> 08:27.710
with you.

08:28.979 --> 08:30.950
I'll stand proudly in front of your family...

08:32.380 --> 08:33.279
and tell them...

08:35.150 --> 08:36.590
I want to be with you.

08:56.710 --> 08:57.810
After today,

08:59.040 --> 09:00.940
we can't see each other often anymore.

09:39.680 --> 09:40.680
Xiao Qin...

09:41.349 --> 09:43.749
is not who you think she is.

09:44.349 --> 09:45.719
She's just looking out for you.

09:45.790 --> 09:47.160
You misunderstood her.

09:47.219 --> 09:48.930
She's concerned about you.

10:00.170 --> 10:01.840
Don't sleep when you're angry.

10:02.310 --> 10:03.440
If you sleep when you're angry, it'll bottle up inside you...

10:03.509 --> 10:04.840
and you'll be silly the next day.

10:05.310 --> 10:07.009
If you have anything to say, just say it.

10:07.680 --> 10:08.849
Vent it to me.

10:09.109 --> 10:10.509
Just vent it.

10:17.119 --> 10:18.560
Okay.

10:38.710 --> 10:39.840
The current time...

10:39.910 --> 10:42.280
is 10:21pm.

10:42.749 --> 10:45.109
It's 27.7 degrees Celsius.

10:48.550 --> 10:49.219
Mom.

10:49.690 --> 10:50.590
Is Qin Qin back?

10:51.320 --> 10:52.489
She has an appointment today.

10:52.989 --> 10:53.690
I'm going out.

10:53.759 --> 10:54.920
Don't wait for me for dinner.

10:55.190 --> 10:56.030
Yan Chen.

10:58.830 --> 10:59.499
Come on.

11:01.060 --> 11:02.070
Do you still remember her?

11:02.700 --> 11:03.700
She's the Gu family's daughter,

11:04.170 --> 11:04.830
Xiao Man.

11:04.899 --> 11:05.700
Hello.

11:06.800 --> 11:07.599
Hi.

11:07.840 --> 11:09.009
Last time,

11:09.410 --> 11:10.739
I asked you two to meet,

11:11.009 --> 11:12.210
but you didn't show up.

11:12.639 --> 11:13.609
Shouldn't you...

11:13.680 --> 11:15.410
apologize to her?

11:17.450 --> 11:18.749
I'm really sorry, Ms. Gu.

11:19.149 --> 11:20.519
I had an urgent meeting last time.

11:20.820 --> 11:22.550
That's why I canceled it.

11:22.820 --> 11:23.489
I'm sorry.

11:23.550 --> 11:24.219
It's okay.

11:24.290 --> 11:25.989
I know you're usually busy with work.

11:28.519 --> 11:29.729
Where are you going?

11:31.389 --> 11:32.599
I'm going to an art exhibition.

11:33.599 --> 11:34.300
Why don't you...

11:35.399 --> 11:36.999
take Xiao Man with you?

11:44.369 --> 11:45.040
Thank you.

11:45.239 --> 11:46.080
Please wait a moment.

11:48.780 --> 11:51.050
I heard you're good at golf.

11:51.379 --> 11:52.180
I'm just so-so.

11:53.519 --> 11:54.680
You're too modest.

11:55.519 --> 11:56.550
My mom doesn't praise...

11:56.619 --> 11:57.420
that many people.

11:57.749 --> 11:58.489
Thank you.

11:58.759 --> 11:59.920
It's not really my favorite hobby.

12:00.290 --> 12:00.989
By the way,

12:01.190 --> 12:02.229
are you a doctor?

12:02.290 --> 12:02.960
Yes.

12:03.030 --> 12:04.229
I'm an emergency medicine doctor.

12:05.190 --> 12:07.060
I'm quite busy with work.

12:07.460 --> 12:08.999
I don't have much time for myself either.

12:09.369 --> 12:10.099
It's good to be busy.

12:10.469 --> 12:11.369
It's fulfilling.

12:11.670 --> 12:12.769
In our industry,

12:12.869 --> 12:14.540
most of the kids inherit their father's business.

12:14.739 --> 12:16.639
You're in a completely different line.

12:16.840 --> 12:18.680
That means you're very courageous...

12:18.739 --> 12:19.739
and have a strong personality.

12:21.109 --> 12:22.479
I'm not as good as you think.

12:25.109 --> 12:26.280
I think...

12:26.420 --> 12:28.180
Mrs. Meng already told you about me.

12:29.519 --> 12:31.050
But I still want...

12:31.119 --> 12:32.389
to formally introduce myself.

12:33.190 --> 12:33.920
I'm Dong Jia Nan,

12:34.219 --> 12:34.920
28 years old.

12:35.219 --> 12:36.229
I graduated from a Business School.

12:36.430 --> 12:38.430
Now, I'm running a multi-channel network company.

12:38.999 --> 12:39.999
I like sports,

12:40.259 --> 12:41.629
skiing, and diving.

12:41.700 --> 12:42.999
I don't have any bad habits.

12:45.269 --> 12:47.269
My mom likes you.

12:47.800 --> 12:49.440
She wants you to marry into the family...

12:49.509 --> 12:51.009
and enjoy life.

12:51.410 --> 12:52.540
It's best to give birth to a son.

12:53.340 --> 12:54.139
As for me,

12:54.710 --> 12:56.310
I think you're really my type.

12:56.649 --> 12:57.580
Most importantly,

12:57.710 --> 12:59.050
the two of us are compatible...

12:59.479 --> 13:00.749
in every way.

13:01.180 --> 13:02.619
We're compatible in terms of qualifications,

13:04.290 --> 13:05.690
but not in terms of personality.

13:07.060 --> 13:08.389
What do you mean?

13:10.460 --> 13:11.790
I'm really sorry.

13:12.060 --> 13:13.259
I already have a boyfriend.

13:15.469 --> 13:16.170
Thank you.

13:17.229 --> 13:18.030
Enjoy.

13:19.269 --> 13:20.239
I'm sorry.

13:20.300 --> 13:21.239
I'll go first.

13:24.239 --> 13:25.109
But I...

13:52.399 --> 13:53.440
Take your time.

13:55.639 --> 13:56.710
I'm going to the restroom.

14:17.629 --> 14:18.729
How much is this painting?

14:18.999 --> 14:20.330
I'm not a staff member now.

14:20.399 --> 14:21.800
I'm already off work.

14:23.800 --> 14:24.599
I'm sorry.

14:25.369 --> 14:26.170
It's all right.

14:27.300 --> 14:29.070
Mr. Meng, do you want to buy this painting?

14:30.670 --> 14:31.410
Don't you think it's a good idea?

14:33.080 --> 14:34.879
Memories should be kept in your heart,

14:35.180 --> 14:36.710
not hung on the wall.

14:36.879 --> 14:37.680
This painting...

14:37.749 --> 14:39.349
looks beautiful on the surface,

14:39.580 --> 14:41.420
but it's a regret in one's heart.

14:41.719 --> 14:43.519
Look at the green plum on this tree.

14:43.590 --> 14:44.619
It tastes sour and bitter.

14:45.619 --> 14:46.820
They're childhood sweethearts.

14:47.290 --> 14:48.320
They probably...

14:48.389 --> 14:49.830
missed out on each other.

14:51.129 --> 14:52.160
You interpreted...

14:52.999 --> 14:54.999
the joy in childhood as a sad story.

14:57.570 --> 14:59.639
Maybe I'm a bit pessimistic.

14:59.999 --> 15:01.300
People who are nostalgic...

15:02.139 --> 15:04.009
usually don't live a happy life.

15:05.540 --> 15:06.340
Why do you say that?

15:08.910 --> 15:11.080
Maybe his memories were too sweet,

15:11.649 --> 15:12.920
so he wants...

15:12.979 --> 15:15.080
to bring back the good memories of the past.

15:15.790 --> 15:16.889
But he also knows...

15:17.489 --> 15:18.550
that if you miss out on something good,

15:18.619 --> 15:20.119
you'll never get it back.

15:20.219 --> 15:22.129
He understands that things have changed.

15:23.060 --> 15:24.759
He knows that the memories he brought back...

15:24.989 --> 15:26.629
would only leave him with regrets...

15:26.859 --> 15:28.499
and vague recollections.

15:35.099 --> 15:36.239
Now that you've said that,

15:37.269 --> 15:38.609
how can I buy this painting anymore?

15:38.710 --> 15:39.509
It's up to you.

15:40.109 --> 15:41.310
I wouldn't buy it if I were you.

15:41.910 --> 15:43.749
After all, this painting costs 80,000 yuan.

15:44.509 --> 15:45.450
It's too expensive.

15:45.879 --> 15:46.680
Is it?

15:48.180 --> 15:49.420
When I watched dramas as a kid,

15:49.489 --> 15:50.219
I wondered...

15:50.619 --> 15:51.920
what kind of person...

15:51.989 --> 15:53.759
would buy a painting from a gallery.

15:54.420 --> 15:55.590
Now, I've seen them.

15:55.989 --> 15:56.989
I get it.

15:57.729 --> 15:58.859
What you're trying to say is...

15:59.160 --> 16:00.359
this painting isn't worth it.

16:00.759 --> 16:01.729
Not really.

16:02.060 --> 16:03.200
To ordinary people,

16:03.269 --> 16:04.499
it's not worth it indeed.

16:04.670 --> 16:05.899
But to you guys,

16:06.399 --> 16:08.099
money is just a tool.

16:08.440 --> 16:09.639
You do something or buy something...

16:09.710 --> 16:11.440
just because you can.

16:13.739 --> 16:14.780
Like you said,

16:15.680 --> 16:16.950
money is just a tool.

16:18.310 --> 16:19.979
I also have unfulfilled wishes...

16:21.149 --> 16:22.389
and regrets in my heart.

16:24.989 --> 16:25.820
There you are.

16:30.160 --> 16:31.330
I've been looking for you.

16:33.660 --> 16:34.899
Are you looking at this painting?

16:35.769 --> 16:36.629
What do you think?

16:38.499 --> 16:39.369
It's okay.

16:39.800 --> 16:41.170
I've never liked looking at paintings since I was a kid.

16:41.239 --> 16:42.269
I find it really boring.

16:43.609 --> 16:44.639
Let's go shopping.

16:46.109 --> 16:47.509
I want to finish this exhibition.

16:49.050 --> 16:49.849
All right then.

16:50.080 --> 16:51.310
Enjoy your exhibition.

16:51.509 --> 16:52.580
I'll go shopping.

16:57.019 --> 16:57.820
Bye.

17:01.019 --> 17:01.989
Bye.

17:53.379 --> 17:54.040
Get in.

18:06.590 --> 18:07.389
Thank you.

18:08.389 --> 18:09.760
I'll take you to the nearest MRT station.

18:10.330 --> 18:11.129
Sure.

18:11.929 --> 18:13.000
Put the seatbelt on.

18:13.859 --> 18:14.560
Okay.

18:25.639 --> 18:26.510
Look.

18:27.439 --> 18:29.250
Their absence at the station...

18:30.550 --> 18:31.949
still makes me a little sad.

18:34.879 --> 18:36.290
What did I tell you before?

18:36.990 --> 18:37.820
It's impractical.

18:38.750 --> 18:39.990
They all have their own jobs.

18:40.260 --> 18:41.720
How can they cooperate with you...

18:41.990 --> 18:43.129
at the station for a long time?

18:43.189 --> 18:44.859
Wait, wasn't I trying to promote...

18:44.929 --> 18:47.359
the medical development of our fire station?

18:48.000 --> 18:49.699
If it doesn't work, I'll keep checking and studying...

18:49.770 --> 18:50.929
if there's a possibility...

18:51.000 --> 18:52.639
of adding more medical staff.

18:53.099 --> 18:54.199
Look at you.

18:54.699 --> 18:55.909
You just won't give up.

18:57.409 --> 18:58.510
Don't say that.

18:59.109 --> 19:00.609
Our linkage mechanism...

19:00.679 --> 19:02.240
is already established.

19:02.310 --> 19:04.379
It's considered a small accomplishment.

19:05.919 --> 19:06.750
Jiang Yu.

19:07.220 --> 19:08.119
I admire...

19:08.720 --> 19:09.389
your optimism.

19:11.820 --> 19:13.520
I admire your optimism too.

19:14.159 --> 19:16.389
You won't be able to see Dr. Xu for a while.

19:16.990 --> 19:17.830
When the time comes,

19:18.560 --> 19:20.699
let's see if you'll still be happy.

19:27.869 --> 19:29.010
You're such a nag.

19:34.240 --> 19:34.909
Instructor.

19:35.240 --> 19:36.179
Are you okay?

19:36.780 --> 19:37.649
I'm fine.

19:40.419 --> 19:41.080
Something is stuck in my teeth.

19:56.230 --> 19:56.970
The team leader is over there.

19:57.030 --> 19:58.099
- Come on. - Let's go over there.

20:01.300 --> 20:03.209
Dr. Xu, let us join you.

20:04.040 --> 20:04.909
Have a seat.

20:09.310 --> 20:10.349
Dr. Yang.

20:19.189 --> 20:19.919
We have the same food.

20:19.990 --> 20:20.959
Do you like pork trotters too?

20:21.060 --> 20:21.919
It's delicious.

20:27.659 --> 20:29.169
Do you want the hospital to be reorganized?

20:31.500 --> 20:32.639
It's rare for us...

20:32.699 --> 20:33.840
to have a meal together and chat a bit.

20:34.070 --> 20:35.869
Do you have to talk about such a grand topic?

20:36.340 --> 20:37.669
Do you like being a doctor...

20:37.740 --> 20:39.340
because you think your effort is commensurate...

20:39.409 --> 20:40.209
to what you get in return?

20:40.280 --> 20:43.149
Or is it mostly out of professional pride?

20:46.320 --> 20:47.619
I was just thinking...

20:47.679 --> 20:48.619
of organizing my answers...

20:48.679 --> 20:49.619
to your last question.

20:49.820 --> 20:51.320
Why did you change the question again?

20:52.090 --> 20:52.889
I'm sorry.

20:52.959 --> 20:53.919
Which one do you want to answer then?

20:54.189 --> 20:55.520
I don't want to answer any of them.

20:55.619 --> 20:56.429
Dr. Yang.

20:58.129 --> 20:59.659
I know what you want to ask.

21:00.159 --> 21:01.000
You want to say...

21:01.230 --> 21:02.570
that a career is a career.

21:03.000 --> 21:03.830
Right?

21:05.030 --> 21:05.840
Who wouldn't want that?

21:06.500 --> 21:07.399
Look at us.

21:07.899 --> 21:09.609
We work our butts off every day.

21:10.040 --> 21:10.740
We just earn...

21:11.010 --> 21:12.310
so little money.

21:12.439 --> 21:13.609
I got a PhD in school.

21:14.040 --> 21:14.810
Do you know...

21:14.879 --> 21:15.780
how much my salary was...

21:15.980 --> 21:16.980
the first year I was here?

21:18.080 --> 21:19.720
The salary doesn't matter.

21:20.280 --> 21:21.349
What matters is that I'm tired.

21:21.419 --> 21:23.050
The workload is too much.

21:23.119 --> 21:24.720
I get anxious when I'm tired.

21:24.990 --> 21:25.720
Tell me.

21:25.790 --> 21:27.389
How many times have I been criticized this month?

21:27.760 --> 21:28.990
It can't be helped.

21:29.230 --> 21:30.760
There are too many patients.

21:31.189 --> 21:33.099
Medical resources are limited.

21:33.159 --> 21:34.899
We can't just leave them to die.

21:36.699 --> 21:38.000
That's why...

21:38.199 --> 21:39.399
I get mad easily,

21:39.470 --> 21:40.399
but my anger is gone quickly too.

21:41.800 --> 21:42.639
It can't be helped.

21:42.939 --> 21:44.139
Our line of work...

21:44.209 --> 21:45.810
concerns life and death and care.

21:45.879 --> 21:47.010
It's not the same...

21:47.080 --> 21:48.139
as an ordinary profession.

21:49.310 --> 21:50.179
By the way, Dr. Xu,

21:50.649 --> 21:52.649
I'll answer your second question.

21:53.349 --> 21:54.679
Do I feel a sense of honor?

21:55.280 --> 21:56.189
Of course I do.

21:56.750 --> 21:57.790
I save lives and help the injured.

21:58.189 --> 21:59.590
Why can't I have a sense of honor?

22:00.560 --> 22:01.659
When I travel...

22:01.859 --> 22:03.790
and my companions find out that I'm a doctor,

22:04.060 --> 22:05.929
do you know how envious they are?

22:06.300 --> 22:06.959
It's true.

22:07.129 --> 22:08.060
I'm so proud of myself.

22:08.260 --> 22:09.060
Very proud.

22:10.300 --> 22:11.429
Don't you think...

22:11.800 --> 22:13.439
that honor is also a burden?

22:13.800 --> 22:15.240
It requires you to be selfless...

22:15.300 --> 22:16.270
and sacrificial.

22:17.270 --> 22:18.240
I'm willing to do that.

22:18.840 --> 22:20.010
The sense of honor...

22:20.080 --> 22:21.580
from pulling patients back from the brink of death...

22:21.909 --> 22:22.679
is something...

22:22.750 --> 22:23.949
that can't be compared to anything else.

22:28.119 --> 22:28.919
I know.

22:29.419 --> 22:30.220
You don't understand.

22:30.290 --> 22:31.520
I get what you mean.

22:31.990 --> 22:33.820
I just don't quite like this kind of viewpoint.

22:33.990 --> 22:35.359
They say a thing has its worth.

22:35.459 --> 22:37.389
But I think a person has their worth.

22:37.830 --> 22:39.599
The need to measure the value of a person...

22:39.659 --> 22:40.560
with his profession...

22:40.929 --> 22:41.899
and not just fill him...

22:41.959 --> 22:43.500
with selflessness and love.

22:43.830 --> 22:45.599
It would be too sad...

22:46.040 --> 22:47.270
for the person in question.

22:47.439 --> 22:48.439
I don't like it.

22:50.909 --> 22:52.639
And from another perspective...

22:56.480 --> 22:57.879
Dr. Xu.

22:58.980 --> 23:00.520
I didn't mean to make you look bad.

23:02.480 --> 23:03.349
Let's eat.

23:30.209 --> 23:31.949
(Xu Qin)

23:39.290 --> 23:41.659
(Xu Qin)

23:53.270 --> 23:54.000
Hello?

23:56.740 --> 23:57.470
Hello?

23:59.609 --> 24:00.980
(Xu Qin)

24:09.280 --> 24:10.090
Hello?

24:11.290 --> 24:12.149
I...

24:13.359 --> 24:14.189
called the wrong number.

24:15.590 --> 24:16.389
Is that so?

24:19.359 --> 24:20.500
I meant to call Jiang Yu.

24:20.699 --> 24:21.500
I dialed the wrong number.

24:21.699 --> 24:22.970
Jiang and Xu...

24:23.030 --> 24:25.099
should be far apart in the contact list.

24:32.040 --> 24:33.340
Must you have such a quick reaction?

24:34.040 --> 24:35.639
I have a high IQ, okay?

24:37.709 --> 24:38.709
You have a low EQ.

24:40.750 --> 24:42.919
I've had a low EQ for a while.

24:46.820 --> 24:48.459
Can you not be so bold and confident?

24:48.959 --> 24:49.629
No.

25:04.869 --> 25:05.869
Did you call...

25:05.939 --> 25:07.080
just to tell me...

25:07.139 --> 25:08.139
that I have low EQ?

25:10.550 --> 25:11.250
No.

25:14.520 --> 25:15.379
I...

25:19.959 --> 25:20.760
By the way,

25:21.419 --> 25:22.220
let me ask you.

25:22.990 --> 25:23.959
Have you finished...

25:24.030 --> 25:25.389
the joint team's interim report?

25:26.730 --> 25:27.459
Yes.

25:27.530 --> 25:28.899
I already gave it to Jiang Yu.

25:30.030 --> 25:30.699
Is that so?

25:32.699 --> 25:33.570
I'll go find him then.

25:34.599 --> 25:35.369
Okay, I have to go.

25:35.439 --> 25:36.139
Bye.

25:37.109 --> 25:37.939
Song Yan.

25:46.720 --> 25:47.520
Bye.

25:50.550 --> 25:51.220
Bye.

26:12.139 --> 26:13.209
Excuse me.

26:17.909 --> 26:18.879
Don't look on. Thank you.

26:19.149 --> 26:19.820
Don't look on.

26:24.349 --> 26:25.220
Da Peng, Pi Pi.

26:25.349 --> 26:26.020
Clippers.

26:26.090 --> 26:26.760
Ma'am.

26:27.720 --> 26:28.389
Ma'am.

26:28.790 --> 26:29.929
Ma'am, don't move.

26:30.030 --> 26:31.129
You'll hurt your finger this way.

26:31.459 --> 26:32.429
Sir, look.

26:32.590 --> 26:33.530
It's already so swollen.

26:33.599 --> 26:34.359
If we don't cut it,

26:34.429 --> 26:35.560
it won't come off anymore.

26:35.830 --> 26:37.470
Ma'am, stop trying.

26:37.830 --> 26:38.599
Cut it.

26:39.840 --> 26:40.540
Cut it?

26:40.599 --> 26:42.240
If you cut the ring, I'll have to pay for it.

26:42.599 --> 26:44.470
You're partly responsible for this,

26:44.540 --> 26:45.340
you know?

26:45.669 --> 26:46.379
As soon as we came in,

26:46.439 --> 26:48.540
you tried to sell her a ring in the wrong size.

26:48.609 --> 26:49.310
Let me tell you.

26:49.379 --> 26:50.679
You have to take full responsibility.

26:50.750 --> 26:52.849
This lady asked to wear it herself.

26:52.949 --> 26:54.750
We have CCTV footage.

26:55.320 --> 26:56.889
Mom wanted to wear it herself.

27:02.119 --> 27:03.189
Look at you.

27:03.260 --> 27:05.060
We're here to accompany our son...

27:05.129 --> 27:06.929
to buy three gold jewelry for his future wife.

27:07.000 --> 27:08.230
You're so reckless.

27:08.359 --> 27:09.599
Why did you wear a ring?

27:10.230 --> 27:11.429
It's over 10,000 yuan.

27:11.830 --> 27:12.599
Look at you.

27:12.899 --> 27:13.740
Usually,

27:13.800 --> 27:15.070
you're thrifty.

27:15.340 --> 27:17.439
You're not interested in these fancy things at all.

27:17.609 --> 27:18.540
Why did you suddenly...

27:18.609 --> 27:19.909
wear a ring today?

27:21.280 --> 27:21.939
Now, what?

27:22.240 --> 27:23.149
You can't take it off.

27:23.550 --> 27:24.580
It's 10,000 yuan.

27:26.010 --> 27:26.679
Young man.

27:27.480 --> 27:28.149
This is your mom.

27:28.220 --> 27:28.879
As you can see,

27:28.949 --> 27:29.619
she's in a lot of pain.

27:29.689 --> 27:30.490
You decide.

27:30.550 --> 27:31.320
Should I cut it or not?

27:34.419 --> 27:35.790
Is it really impossible to remove it?

27:35.859 --> 27:36.659
If we could,

27:37.159 --> 27:38.330
we wouldn't cut it off.

27:49.000 --> 27:49.740
Ma'am.

27:50.540 --> 27:51.270
Don't be sad.

27:52.609 --> 27:53.280
Don't feel guilty.

27:53.909 --> 27:55.109
This has nothing to do with you.

27:55.879 --> 27:57.310
I believe that what you've done for this family...

27:57.879 --> 27:59.720
is already 10,000 times more than this ring.

28:04.020 --> 28:05.119
Cut it.

28:05.189 --> 28:06.090
Cut it now.

28:06.189 --> 28:06.919
- Come on, Mom. - Ma'am.

28:06.990 --> 28:07.760
Mom, let's cut it.

28:08.720 --> 28:09.520
Ma'am, don't be scared.

28:09.590 --> 28:10.389
Slowly.

28:11.030 --> 28:12.260
Should we use a smaller one?

28:12.590 --> 28:13.730
Here, give it to me.

28:15.859 --> 28:16.629
Ma'am, relax.

28:16.699 --> 28:17.830
- It's okay. - I'll help you.

28:17.970 --> 28:18.770
Tell me if it hurts.

28:18.830 --> 28:19.500
Here, hold onto this.

28:27.909 --> 28:29.139
Okay, slowly.

28:32.679 --> 28:33.480
Slowly.

28:33.679 --> 28:35.149
Ma'am, tell us if it hurts.

28:41.090 --> 28:42.260
Okay, ma'am. Relax.

28:43.030 --> 28:43.689
Done.

28:43.889 --> 28:44.560
Okay, ma'am.

28:46.959 --> 28:47.629
My mom's hand...

28:47.699 --> 28:48.500
won't have any problem, right?

28:48.830 --> 28:49.800
Now, you feel bad for her.

28:50.399 --> 28:51.129
Take her to the hospital.

28:51.199 --> 28:52.000
I'm sure she'll be fine.

28:54.240 --> 28:55.199
I'll pay the bill.

28:55.570 --> 28:56.240
You get the bill.

28:56.310 --> 28:57.939
- I'll go with her to the hospital. - Sir, please pay here.

29:00.740 --> 29:01.439
Good job.

29:01.709 --> 29:02.409
Pack up.

29:02.480 --> 29:03.149
Thank you, Yang Chi.

29:08.020 --> 29:08.679
Miss.

29:08.820 --> 29:09.689
I'd like to discuss something with you.

29:10.090 --> 29:11.220
This ring is so expensive.

29:11.290 --> 29:12.490
It's such a waste to cut it.

29:12.889 --> 29:14.320
Can you talk to the company...

29:14.560 --> 29:15.389
to melt this ring,

29:15.560 --> 29:17.659
then make a necklace pendant or something...

29:18.030 --> 29:18.689
and give it to them?

29:19.260 --> 29:20.399
There's even a diamond on it.

29:20.830 --> 29:21.659
It'll surely look nice.

29:22.800 --> 29:24.099
I'll talk to the company.

29:25.099 --> 29:25.800
Thank you.

29:26.669 --> 29:27.340
Sir.

29:27.399 --> 29:28.540
Give me your contact number.

29:28.869 --> 29:30.139
When the necklace is done,

29:30.340 --> 29:31.310
ask your mom to pick it up.

29:31.470 --> 29:32.139
Thank you.

29:32.740 --> 29:33.409
Thank you.

29:33.480 --> 29:34.139
Command Center.

29:34.280 --> 29:35.109
We've taken the ring off.

29:35.310 --> 29:36.040
Requesting permission to return.

29:36.949 --> 29:37.609
Copy that.

29:38.080 --> 29:38.750
Let's go.

30:01.570 --> 30:02.470
There's no bleeding.

30:11.550 --> 30:12.980
Make sure the skin is aligned.

30:13.149 --> 30:14.320
Keep the drainage tube open.

30:14.550 --> 30:15.379
Yes, Dr. Xu.

30:15.580 --> 30:17.720
(Branch Director's Office)

30:24.260 --> 30:24.959
Dr. Xu.

30:25.030 --> 30:25.730
Please come in.

30:33.470 --> 30:35.439
I saw you observing my surgery earlier,

30:36.199 --> 30:37.510
so I wanted to ask...

30:37.740 --> 30:38.869
if you have any comments...

30:38.939 --> 30:40.080
or advice for me.

30:40.280 --> 30:42.179
Your advice is very precious to me.

30:44.709 --> 30:46.349
Your skills are perfect.

30:46.520 --> 30:47.919
I have nothing to teach you.

30:50.149 --> 30:50.949
But you...

30:51.149 --> 30:52.349
still have a problem with me,

30:52.419 --> 30:53.159
right?

30:55.790 --> 30:57.490
You always give me the feeling...

30:57.560 --> 30:59.959
that you treat your patients like a rabbit...

31:00.260 --> 31:01.500
in an experiment.

31:05.169 --> 31:05.970
Dr. Xu.

31:06.800 --> 31:08.199
I've always known clearly...

31:08.439 --> 31:09.840
where our differences lie.

31:10.840 --> 31:11.810
But I think...

31:12.010 --> 31:13.740
it's just a difference of opinion between people.

31:13.810 --> 31:14.909
It's harmless.

31:16.949 --> 31:18.310
You think it's harmless?

31:21.349 --> 31:22.179
You and I...

31:22.280 --> 31:23.820
have different views on medicine.

31:24.189 --> 31:25.220
But we have the same goal.

31:25.290 --> 31:26.149
We just need to save people.

31:26.990 --> 31:27.859
You think...

31:27.919 --> 31:29.419
a doctor must have heart and feelings.

31:29.859 --> 31:30.530
But I don't think so.

31:30.590 --> 31:31.889
What's wrong with dealing with problems...

31:31.959 --> 31:33.359
with a calm attitude as an outsider?

31:34.000 --> 31:34.699
This is nothing more...

31:34.760 --> 31:36.099
than a difference of opinion.

31:38.830 --> 31:40.699
A doctor is a human.

31:42.669 --> 31:43.470
Dr. Xu.

31:45.240 --> 31:46.139
Do you still remember...

31:46.209 --> 31:47.609
the vow you made...

31:47.679 --> 31:48.639
when you initially chose...

31:48.709 --> 31:49.949
to study medicine?

31:50.480 --> 31:52.109
"I will consciously uphold..."

31:52.179 --> 31:54.520
"the dignity, sanctity,"

31:54.780 --> 31:56.080
"and noble traditions of medicine."

31:56.349 --> 31:58.119
"I will give human life..."

31:58.520 --> 31:59.689
"the greatest respect,"

32:00.090 --> 32:02.119
- "equality, and benevolence." - I memorized it.

32:05.659 --> 32:06.560
Xu Qin.

32:08.659 --> 32:10.000
Your biggest problem...

32:10.070 --> 32:11.000
is that you lack...

32:11.800 --> 32:13.869
basic belief in your profession.

32:14.599 --> 32:16.869
You've ignored the oath of a doctor.

32:17.540 --> 32:18.439
That's why...

32:18.510 --> 32:21.179
you can't feel the honor and tradition of medicine.

32:22.679 --> 32:24.449
But it's precisely because...

32:25.179 --> 32:27.080
you're such a talented surgeon...

32:30.149 --> 32:31.020
that I...

32:31.990 --> 32:33.090
feel so heartbroken.

32:43.030 --> 32:43.830
Yang Chi.

32:44.899 --> 32:47.369
I heard this place's Dirty Bun is really good.

32:47.470 --> 32:48.939
It's also famous on the Internet.

32:49.000 --> 32:49.669
You punk.

32:49.740 --> 32:51.070
Eat, eat, and eat. All you do is eat.

32:52.270 --> 32:53.070
Let's try it.

32:54.609 --> 32:55.280
It's too expensive.

32:56.310 --> 32:56.980
It's no big deal.

32:57.050 --> 32:58.310
Just think of it...

32:59.050 --> 32:59.709
as a reward...

32:59.879 --> 33:00.550
for accomplishing the task.

33:00.849 --> 33:01.520
Yang Chi.

33:04.419 --> 33:05.389
It's on me.

33:05.949 --> 33:06.760
Thank you, Yang Chi.

33:06.820 --> 33:07.560
Thank you, Yang Chi.

33:08.020 --> 33:09.220
Yang Chi, Chief.

33:10.159 --> 33:10.830
Thank you.

33:17.470 --> 33:18.129
Not bad.

33:18.869 --> 33:19.800
It's really good.

33:21.500 --> 33:22.500
But it's too expensive.

33:22.840 --> 33:24.310
It's over 20 yuan each.

33:24.470 --> 33:25.409
Isn't that robbery?

33:25.639 --> 33:26.540
Everything is expensive nowadays.

33:26.609 --> 33:27.409
Jiang Yi.

33:29.409 --> 33:30.080
Jiang Yi.

33:30.149 --> 33:30.810
Class Monitor.

33:31.050 --> 33:32.109
You've been firefighters...

33:32.179 --> 33:33.449
for over eight years, right?

33:33.580 --> 33:34.580
Are you planning to stay...

33:34.649 --> 33:35.379
or change careers?

33:37.619 --> 33:39.689
No. What's wrong with asking?

33:40.159 --> 33:40.820
Tell us.

33:43.020 --> 33:43.730
You don't want to answer?

33:44.230 --> 33:45.429
If they don't want to talk, I'll say it for them.

33:46.359 --> 33:47.399
Jun Ping already told me.

33:47.459 --> 33:48.260
He's surely not leaving.

33:48.599 --> 33:49.500
As for Jiang Yi,

33:49.560 --> 33:50.429
I don't know.

33:50.629 --> 33:51.929
After all, he's always had a dream of repairing cars.

33:52.000 --> 33:53.240
He wants to be a mechanic.

33:53.500 --> 33:54.869
Stop talking nonsense.

33:55.000 --> 33:56.070
Don't listen to him.

33:56.439 --> 33:57.709
That was years ago.

33:59.109 --> 34:00.609
What was the plan then?

34:00.939 --> 34:02.310
After completing my military service,

34:02.379 --> 34:03.649
I'll go back to my hometown and open an auto repair shop.

34:04.050 --> 34:05.109
My mom wasn't well.

34:05.250 --> 34:06.849
I wanted to go back and spend more time with her.

34:07.679 --> 34:09.280
Logically speaking, the most suitable job...

34:09.550 --> 34:10.750
for firefighters...

34:10.889 --> 34:11.889
is actually fire safety management...

34:11.949 --> 34:13.590
in a corporation.

34:13.790 --> 34:14.889
That's the best.

34:15.389 --> 34:16.729
But there are too many talents now.

34:16.789 --> 34:17.859
If you don't have connections,

34:18.160 --> 34:18.930
you really can't get in.

34:20.430 --> 34:21.459
But it's fine now.

34:21.899 --> 34:22.760
There was a reform.

34:23.300 --> 34:24.530
Not only can we stay,

34:24.600 --> 34:26.229
but the pay is much higher too.

34:26.970 --> 34:28.169
And I've worked here for so many years.

34:28.240 --> 34:29.300
I have the experience.

34:29.499 --> 34:30.410
I want to stay too...

34:30.539 --> 34:31.240
and continue contributing...

34:31.410 --> 34:32.410
to the station.

34:34.010 --> 34:34.879
We're all lucky.

34:35.579 --> 34:37.079
We get to enjoy the benefits after the reform.

34:37.350 --> 34:38.010
Yes.

34:38.579 --> 34:39.379
So tell me,

34:39.749 --> 34:40.649
will I leave or not?

34:43.149 --> 34:43.919
You're right.

34:44.120 --> 34:44.990
Anyway,

34:45.220 --> 34:46.050
if Jun Ping doesn't leave and you don't,

34:46.120 --> 34:47.490
then let's all not leave.

34:47.559 --> 34:48.820
Let's stay together for the rest of our lives.

34:49.260 --> 34:49.919
Let's eat.

34:51.430 --> 34:52.090
Here.

34:52.629 --> 34:53.959
To the Fire Department's reform.

34:54.160 --> 34:54.829
Cheers.

34:55.030 --> 34:56.870
- Here, cheers. - Here, cheers.

34:59.430 --> 35:00.169
Stop thinking about it.

35:00.240 --> 35:02.070
Dr. Xu will definitely object to it.

35:02.899 --> 35:03.910
What will I object to?

35:05.010 --> 35:06.410
The hospital just issued an urgent notice...

35:06.470 --> 35:07.910
for a fire drill.

35:08.740 --> 35:10.579
All we need to do is hold a towel, cover our noses,

35:10.649 --> 35:11.910
and bend while going downstairs.

35:12.050 --> 35:13.280
But Dr. Xu,

35:13.450 --> 35:14.249
you've been chosen.

35:15.620 --> 35:16.519
For what?

35:16.950 --> 35:19.289
To play a medical staff and a patient.

35:19.350 --> 35:20.689
And you're the one left behind...

35:20.760 --> 35:21.959
after the trapped people...

35:22.220 --> 35:23.189
get rescued.

35:24.760 --> 35:27.999
(Based on the lots drawn, Dr. Xu Qin will be the doctor trapped)

35:30.899 --> 35:32.030
Why was I chosen?

35:32.629 --> 35:33.340
Well...

35:33.399 --> 35:34.999
Maybe you're the one...

35:35.070 --> 35:36.470
who looks the most likely to be left behind.

35:38.309 --> 35:40.209
That's because our team leader...

35:40.280 --> 35:41.680
is very competent, good at her job,

35:41.809 --> 35:43.039
and also quick-witted.

35:44.180 --> 35:44.850
Okay.

35:45.309 --> 35:46.280
I'll play this role then.

35:49.280 --> 35:49.950
How could you say that?

35:50.019 --> 35:51.019
What's the matter with you?

35:51.090 --> 35:52.320
Why do I get the feeling...

35:52.390 --> 35:53.890
Dr. Xu is not unhappy?

35:54.019 --> 35:54.789
Can't you tell...

35:54.959 --> 35:56.160
what she's feeling?

35:59.030 --> 36:00.829
Doesn't she look the same whether she's happy or not?

36:42.100 --> 36:46.209
(We'll go when there's a report, we'll move once we hear about it)

37:01.390 --> 37:02.289
- Good morning, Dr. Xu. - Good morning.

37:04.760 --> 37:05.490
Good morning, Dr. Xu.

37:05.559 --> 37:06.359
- Good morning. - We have a fire drill today.

37:06.430 --> 37:07.229
Hurry and get changed.

37:07.859 --> 37:08.859
- See you later. - See you.

37:13.600 --> 37:15.140
The fire drill is about to begin.

37:15.399 --> 37:16.970
Relevant medical personnel in the general ward...

37:17.039 --> 37:18.939
from the 5th to 7th floor, please get ready.

37:19.010 --> 37:19.709
- Other... - Sir.

37:19.939 --> 37:22.280
- We're conducting a fire drill. - Dr. Xu, ready for the fire drill?

37:22.340 --> 37:23.680
We have to go and get ready.

37:23.910 --> 37:24.579
Dr. Xu.

37:24.649 --> 37:25.479
Good luck with the fire drill.

37:25.910 --> 37:26.680
Yes.

37:26.749 --> 37:27.620
There will be firefighters.

37:27.680 --> 37:29.519
- You have to go and get ready. - Let's go.

37:33.149 --> 37:34.090
- Hurry up. - Hurry.

37:35.160 --> 37:36.660
- Come on. - Be careful.

37:37.059 --> 37:37.729
- Cover your mouth and nose. - This way.

37:37.789 --> 37:39.030
- Evacuate in an orderly manner. - This way.

37:39.660 --> 37:40.359
Cover your mouth and nose.

37:40.430 --> 37:41.329
- Evacuate in an orderly manner. - Slowly.

37:41.459 --> 37:42.899
- This way. - Watch your step.

37:43.430 --> 37:44.430
- Come on. - Isn't this just a drill?

37:44.499 --> 37:45.370
- They're making it such a big deal. - Take care of yourself. This way.

37:45.430 --> 37:46.100
That's right.

37:46.169 --> 37:47.200
Go down from there. Yes.

37:47.399 --> 37:48.200
Come on. This way.

37:48.269 --> 37:49.740
It's quite fun. It's like acting.

37:51.870 --> 37:53.109
Come on. Slow down at the back.

37:57.280 --> 37:57.950
Come on.

37:59.109 --> 38:00.320
Walk in front of me. Hurry.

38:06.090 --> 38:07.390
Be careful.

38:08.019 --> 38:09.359
"Since the fire is too big,"

38:09.519 --> 38:11.289
"a doctor is trapped..."

38:11.359 --> 38:13.260
"in the Dispensing Room next to the nurses' station..."

38:13.390 --> 38:14.359
"and can't break through."

38:15.160 --> 38:16.499
"She can only wait for help."

38:19.030 --> 38:20.169
I'm a doctor.

38:20.240 --> 38:21.870
What am I doing in the Dispensary Room?

38:23.640 --> 38:25.669
This is obviously a minor person's role.

38:27.340 --> 38:28.309
So what if I'm left behind?

38:28.780 --> 38:29.579
It's peaceful.

38:45.260 --> 38:45.930
That was fast.

38:55.999 --> 38:57.510
(Emergency fire drill)

39:01.910 --> 39:07.350
(Fire Department)

39:15.320 --> 39:16.390
Squad One, set up the ladder.

39:16.459 --> 39:17.930
Squad Two, evacuate the people.

39:18.059 --> 39:19.160
Squad Three, put out the fire inside.

39:19.229 --> 39:20.260
- Got it! - Yes!

39:21.600 --> 39:22.899
Get ready to put out the fire. Be quick!

39:23.700 --> 39:24.399
Hurry.

39:45.350 --> 39:47.019
Spread out on the 5th to 7th floor.

39:53.959 --> 39:54.629
This way.

39:54.999 --> 39:56.660
What are you doing?

39:57.329 --> 39:58.129
What are you doing here?

39:58.329 --> 39:59.329
Come on.

40:19.350 --> 40:20.789
If there really was a fire,

40:21.459 --> 40:22.990
I'd be dead by now.

40:27.600 --> 40:28.559
I thought...

40:29.829 --> 40:31.499
at least one firefighter...

40:31.769 --> 40:32.999
wouldn't leave me behind.

40:38.539 --> 40:39.340
Why aren't you running?

40:39.539 --> 40:40.340
What are you doing here?

40:41.240 --> 40:42.280
It's a fire drill.

40:42.579 --> 40:43.749
I'm the one left behind.

40:47.079 --> 40:48.249
If this were a real fire,

40:48.320 --> 40:50.120
you would have found a corpse by now.

40:50.180 --> 40:51.120
If you don't call for help,

40:51.419 --> 40:52.220
who would know you were here?

40:55.320 --> 40:56.590
It's in the drill plan.

40:56.660 --> 40:58.559
There's a person trapped in the Dispensary Room.

40:58.660 --> 40:59.390
We don't know.

40:59.729 --> 41:00.559
There's no specific location.

41:01.859 --> 41:03.200
It doesn't say to call for help.

41:03.260 --> 41:04.169
After hiding in the restroom for so long,

41:04.399 --> 41:05.899
I finally avoided the fire drill.

41:06.070 --> 41:07.070
Me too.

41:07.600 --> 41:08.769
What are we having for dinner?

41:08.840 --> 41:12.070
(Take care of your body, pay attention to your health)

41:16.079 --> 41:17.280
Now that you've found me,

41:17.510 --> 41:18.680
can you rescue me now?

41:20.280 --> 41:21.519
The fire has been burning for half an hour.

41:22.019 --> 41:22.879
No one can save you.

41:23.019 --> 41:23.890
Stay here.

41:24.090 --> 41:24.950
How do I get out then?

41:25.019 --> 41:26.149
Wait for the ladder truck.

41:28.459 --> 41:29.160
That's right.

41:29.220 --> 41:31.359
The one with a steel platform like a crane?

41:32.729 --> 41:33.800
It's a rescue platform.

41:36.100 --> 41:37.300
In front of everyone,

41:38.430 --> 41:39.930
I'll be transported down like cargo?

41:39.999 --> 41:41.370
That's what you get for having a bad attitude.

42:00.249 --> 42:01.289
- Run! - Run!

42:03.859 --> 42:05.590
- Hurry! - Help!

42:05.660 --> 42:06.660
Run!

42:07.200 --> 42:07.899
Run!

42:11.570 --> 42:12.229
It's an earthquake.

42:17.870 --> 42:19.209
The epicenter is a bit far from here.

42:19.309 --> 42:20.269
But it can't be too far.

42:20.479 --> 42:21.309
How do you know?

42:21.709 --> 42:23.309
The epicenter is always bumpy and then shaky.

42:23.579 --> 42:24.709
From a certain distance,

42:24.850 --> 42:25.850
you can only feel the shaking.

42:29.550 --> 42:30.950
Chief, there was an earthquake!

42:31.019 --> 42:31.890
Is everyone all right?

42:31.950 --> 42:32.620
- We're fine! - We're okay!

42:34.359 --> 42:35.019
Fall in.

42:35.289 --> 42:35.990
- Yes! - Yes!

42:36.189 --> 42:36.859
Move.

42:58.950 --> 43:02.180
(In-Patient Department)
